💼 linkedin.com/in/joseph-denopol-ba507a308
🌐 denopscode-portfolio.vercel.app
📍 Davao City, Philippines`,
      },

      skills: {
        lang: "JSON",
        content: `{
  "developer": "Joseph Mel Resty Denopol",
